# GD-17 (round 19, writer 10): E §5 step 2 "A movement whose fulfils names an adjustment (a settlement) isn't measured
# either"; L §5.14.3 "Settlements are never measured. A movement whose fulfils names an adjustment settles a change".
# L5_7_bind_hole_day_w_on without `fulfils a`: w binds over adjustments but fulfils none, so it is no settlement and is
# measured, and measuring it reads the adjustments it would itself make: refcore refuses RUN-CYCLE (snap14 took every
# move binding over adjustments as a settlement and answered).
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source act "act"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind wages: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input wage_dom: int
input w_on: date
input keep: money PLN
input sweep_dom: int
def net[m in months]: money PLN = wage_amt at start_of(m)

move wage[m in months]: wages
  on day_of(m, wage_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount net[m]

move w[a in adjustments on w_on where a.adjusts in wages]: transfers
  on w_on
  leg cash from world to konto amount a.change

move sweep[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, sweep_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto, end_of(m) - 1 day) from day_of(m, sweep_dom) - keep)

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  wage_amt = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  wage_dom = 10 "umowa"
  sweep_dom = 20 "own"
  keep = 1 000.00 PLN "own"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
  opening[savings] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

version raise_2026
  cite act
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-05-01
  replace wage_amt = 5 500.00 PLN "aneks"

version back_pay_day
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-09-01
  w_on = 2026-09-15 "aneks"

ask q5: count(a in adjustments on w_on) as known 2026-06-30
ask q6: count(a in adjustments on w_on) as known 2026-04-30
=== expect q5 q6
q5: refused: RUN-CYCLE the adjustments read themselves (a measured move reads adjustments)
  cut 2026-06-30
q6: refused: RUN-CYCLE the adjustments read themselves (a measured move reads adjustments)
  cut 2026-04-30
